   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Observed range"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 4422,
   "x": 673,
   "w": 320,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Within-pair affect gaps are absolute differences between the two raw person rows. Politics gaps are absolute score differences; sex, race and education matches require exact category equality."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 4422,
   "x": 1021,
   "w": 320,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Affect, arousal and enjoyment span 1–9 in these data. Shared reality spans 1–7. Correlations are Pearson’s r and use pairwise complete observations."
